&mdash; Shah Rukh Khan (@iamsrk) November 1, 2026
He thanked Google Gemini for the special tribute, writing, &quot;Dost ho toh Google Gemini jaisa.. Thank you for the KING-sized love always.... had to sneak out for a drive to get this photo ha ha..&quot;
